@startuml
title 管理员 - 回收站管理时序图

actor 管理员 as Admin
participant "浏览器/系统回收站\n(admin/SystemRecycle.vue)" as UI
participant "Axios\nrequest.js" as Axios
participant "文件控制器\nFileController" as FileCtrl
participant "文件服务\nFileService" as FileSvc
participant "系统设置服务\nSystemSettingService" as SysSetting
participant "审计日志服务\nAuditLogService" as Audit
database "File/User Repository\n(MySQL)" as DB

== 系统回收站列表（对用户隐藏的已删除文件） ==
Admin -> UI: 打开“系统回收站”
UI -> Axios: GET /api/files/admin/recycle/bin[?fromExec&toExec&scheduledOnly&keyword&reason]
Axios -> FileCtrl: getAllRecycleBinFiles(...)
alt 带筛选条件
  FileCtrl -> FileSvc: getAllRecycleBinFiles(from,to,scheduledOnly,kw,reason)
  FileSvc -> DB: findAdminRecycleFiltered(...)
else 无筛选
  FileCtrl -> FileSvc: getAllRecycleBinFiles()
  FileSvc -> DB: findByDeletedTrueAndOwnerHiddenTrueOrderByDeleteTimeDesc()
end
FileCtrl --> Axios: 200 [AdminFileDTO...]

== 恢复到管理员网盘 ==
Admin -> UI: 点击“恢复”
UI -> Axios: PUT /api/files/admin/{fileId}/restore
Axios -> FileCtrl: adminRestoreFile(fileId)
FileCtrl -> SecurityContext: 获取 adminId
FileCtrl -> FileSvc: adminRestoreFile(fileId, adminId)
FileSvc -> DB: 查找回收站文件、管理员、校验配额
FileSvc -> FS: 移动物理文件到管理员目录、删除缩略图、更新记录并释放原属主配额（如需）
FileCtrl --> Axios: 200 { quotaUsed, quotaLimit }

== 排期删除（进入冷静期） ==
Admin -> UI: 点击“排期删除”并填写理由
UI -> Axios: POST /api/files/admin/recycle/bin/{fileId}/schedule-delete\n{ reason }
Axios -> FileCtrl: adminScheduleDeleteFile(fileId, reason)
FileCtrl -> FileSvc: adminScheduleDeleteFile(...)
FileSvc -> DB: 更新 adminDeleteScheduled=true, adminDeleteExecuteTime, adminDeleteReason
FileCtrl -> Audit: 记录管理员排期删除
FileCtrl --> Axios: 200 { executeTime }

== 手动清理到期文件 ==
Admin -> UI: 点击“清理到期”
UI -> Axios: POST /api/files/admin/recycle/bin/purge-expired
Axios -> FileCtrl: adminPurgeExpired()
FileCtrl -> SysSetting: isManualPurgeEnabled()
alt 未启用
  FileCtrl --> Axios: 403 { message: 手动清理未启用 }
  Axios --> UI: 显示错误
  return
end
FileCtrl -> FileSvc: purgeExpiredScheduledDeletions()
FileSvc -> DB: findByAdminDeleteScheduledTrueAndAdminDeleteExecuteTimeBefore(now) 并批量隐藏/删除
FileCtrl --> Axios: 200 { message, count }

@enduml

